        "Extended periods without rainfall increasing vegetation flammability." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ffonto:ClimateDriver,
        ffonto:Disturbance,
        ffonto:EnvironmentalFactor .

ffonto:EAspect a ffonto:AspectCategory ;
